Placement:

```js
function buildInitialSnake(cfg) {
  var len = cfg.initialLength;
  var dir = cfg.initialDirection;
  var head, dx, dy;
  var midX = Math.floor(cfg.cols / 2);
  var midY = Math.floor(cfg.rows / 2);

  if (dir === "left" || dir === "right") {
    // 限制长度不超过一行可容纳的格数
    len = Math.min(len, cfg.cols);
    if (dir === "right") {
      head = { x: clamp(midX, len - 1, cfg.cols - 1), y: midY };
    } else {
      head = { x: clamp(midX, 0, cfg.cols - len), y: midY };
    }
    dx = dir === "right" ? -1 : 1;
    dy = 0;
  } else {
    len = Math.min(len, cfg.rows);
    if (dir === "down") {
      head = { x: midX, y: clamp(midY, len - 1, cfg.rows - 1) };
    } else {
      head = { x: midX, y: clamp(midY, 0, cfg.rows - len) };
    }
    dx = 0;
    dy = dir === "down" ? -1 : 1;
  }

  var snake = [];
  for (var i = 0; i < len; i += 1) {
    snake.push({ x: head.x + dx * i, y: head.y + dy * i });
  }
  return snake;
}
```

Note for back direction: body extends opposite to movement. For right: body x decreases → dx=-1. For left: body x increases → dx=1. For down: body y decreases → dy=-1. For up: body y increases → dy=1. Correct.

